  Slug: untamed-order
  DisplayName: Untamed Order
  IconPath: icons/magic/nature/stealth-hide-beast-eyes-green.webp
  Description: The uncontrollable call of the natural world courses through your
    body. You might have been raised by a wild animal, or you might have come to
    reject the artifices of cities after growing up in one. Now, primal magic grants
    you the ability to wear the form of an untamed creature. Order Skill Intimidation
    Druid Feat @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Untamed Form] Order Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Untamed
    Shift] Anathema Become fully domesticated by the temptations of civilization.
    (This doesn't prevent you from buying and using processed goods or staying in
    a city for an adventure, but you can never come to rely on these conveniences
    or truly call such a place your permanent home.)
